{"id":"fe079ae5e294c97a","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-fibred-cartesian-closed.md","title":"纤维笛卡尔闭性","display":"df-fibred-cartesian-closed — 纤维笛卡尔闭性","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-df-fibred-cartesian-closed","display":"df-fibred-cartesian-closed — 纤维笛卡尔闭性","depends_on":["[[16-df-fibred-finite-products]]","[[16-df-ccc-definition]]","[[16-df-pullback-square]]"],"source":"§1.8; Definition 4.2.1(iii), p. 233 (PDF 253)","revision_date":"2026-10-15","aliases":["16-df-fibred-cartesian-closed"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-fibred-cartesian-closed"},{"key":"display","html":"df-fibred-cartesian-closed — 纤维笛卡尔闭性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ee7c0663947fd7d2\" href=\"?note=ee7c0663947fd7d2\" title=\"16-df-fibred-finite-products\">16-df-fibred-finite-products</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"18a4c8ba03fadf06\" href=\"?note=18a4c8ba03fadf06\" title=\"16-df-ccc-definition\">16-df-ccc-definition</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"dacf0503b95c88a9\" href=\"?note=dacf0503b95c88a9\" title=\"16-df-pullback-square\">16-df-pullback-square</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"§1.8; Definition 4.2.1(iii), p. 233 (PDF 253)"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-15"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-fibred-cartesian-closed</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\">\\(p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\\)</span> 为带提升选择的纤维化；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u^*:\\mathcal E_J\\to\\mathcal E_I\">\\(u^*:\\mathcal E_J\\to\\mathcal E_I\\)</span> 沿 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u:I\\to J\">\\(u:I\\to J\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FibFinProd}\">\\(\\mathrm{FibFinProd}\\)</span>、纤维积及其保持性采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ee7c0663947fd7d2\" href=\"?note=ee7c0663947fd7d2\" title=\"16-df-fibred-finite-products\">16-df-fibred-finite-products</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CCC}\">\\(\\mathrm{CCC}\\)</span>、指数及评价箭头采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"18a4c8ba03fadf06\" href=\"?note=18a4c8ba03fadf06\" title=\"16-df-ccc-definition\">16-df-ccc-definition</a>。</li>\n<li>在下式有限积与指数存在的合取分支中固定这些结构。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma_{u,A,B}:u^*(A\\times_JB)\\to u^*A\\times_Iu^*B\">\\(\\gamma_{u,A,B}:u^*(A\\times_JB)\\to u^*A\\times_Iu^*B\\)</span> 是积投影诱导的规范比较；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\">\\(c\\)</span> 的定义域、值域及其转置条件均在下文量化。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Iso}_{\\mathcal E_I}\">\\(\\mathrm{Iso}_{\\mathcal E_I}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"dacf0503b95c88a9\" href=\"?note=dacf0503b95c88a9\" title=\"16-df-pullback-square\">16-df-pullback-square</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FibCCC}\">\\(\\mathrm{FibCCC}\\)</span> 是下文定义的谓词。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma^{-1}\">\\(\\gamma^{-1}\\)</span> 仅用于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FibFinProd}(p)\">\\(\\mathrm{FibFinProd}(p)\\)</span> 成立的分支。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\gamma_{u,A,B}\\coloneqq\\langle u^*\\pi_1,u^*\\pi_2\\rangle.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\gamma_{u,A,B}\\coloneqq\\langle u^*\\pi_1,u^*\\pi_2\\rangle.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{FibCCC}(p)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{FibFinProd}(p)\\land(\\forall I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)\\mathrm{CCC}(\\mathcal E_I)\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\forall I,J\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)\n(\\forall u\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal B}(I,J))\n(\\forall X,Y\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_J)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad(\\exists c\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E_I}(u^*(Y^X),(u^*Y)^{u^*X}))\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{Iso}_{\\mathcal E_I}(c)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\qquad\\land\\operatorname{ev}_{u^*X,u^*Y}\\circ(c\\times_I\\operatorname{id}_{u^*X})\n=u^*(\\operatorname{ev}_{X,Y})\\circ\\gamma_{u,Y^X,X}^{-1}\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{FibCCC}(p)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{FibFinProd}(p)\\land(\\forall I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)\\mathrm{CCC}(\\mathcal E_I)\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\forall I,J\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)\n(\\forall u\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal B}(I,J))\n(\\forall X,Y\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_J)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad(\\exists c\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E_I}(u^*(Y^X),(u^*Y)^{u^*X}))\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{Iso}_{\\mathcal E_I}(c)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\qquad\\land\\operatorname{ev}_{u^*X,u^*Y}\\circ(c\\times_I\\operatorname{id}_{u^*X})\n=u^*(\\operatorname{ev}_{X,Y})\\circ\\gamma_{u,Y^X,X}^{-1}\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>指数泛性质保证转置条件中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\">\\(c\\)</span> 唯一。其右侧先从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u^*(Y^X)\\times_Iu^*X\">\\(u^*(Y^X)\\times_Iu^*X\\)</span> 经积比较的逆回到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u^*(Y^X\\times_JX)\">\\(u^*(Y^X\\times_JX)\\)</span>，再应用重索引评价箭头。</li>\n<li>要求这个规范指数比较可逆；任意同构的存在不能替代对评价箭头的相容性。可逆谓词的下标明确是箭头所在纤维。</li>\n<li>这是纤维闭性；闭理解范畴另外涉及理解投影及依赖量词。在预序纤维中指数表示蕴涵。</li>\n<li>来源：Jacobs, §1.8；Definition 4.2.1(iii), p. 233（PDF 第 253 页）。规范比较由积、指数泛性质在此展开。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-fibred-finite-products","status":"resolved","id":"ee7c0663947fd7d2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-fibred-finite-products]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-ccc-definition","status":"resolved","id":"18a4c8ba03fadf06","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-ccc-definition]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-pullback-square","status":"resolved","id":"dacf0503b95c88a9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-pullback-square]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-fibred-finite-products","status":"resolved","id":"ee7c0663947fd7d2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$ 为带提升选择的纤维化；$u^*:\\mathcal E_J\\to\\mathcal E_I$ 沿 $u:I\\to J$。$\\mathrm{FibFinProd}$、纤维积及其保持性采用 [[16-df-fibred-finite-products]]；$\\mathrm{CCC}$、指数及评价箭头采用 [[16-df-ccc-definition]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-ccc-definition","status":"resolved","id":"18a4c8ba03fadf06","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$ 为带提升选择的纤维化；$u^*:\\mathcal E_J\\to\\mathcal E_I$ 沿 $u:I\\to J$。$\\mathrm{FibFinProd}$、纤维积及其保持性采用 [[16-df-fibred-finite-products]]；$\\mathrm{CCC}$、指数及评价箭头采用 [[16-df-ccc-definition]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-pullback-square","status":"resolved","id":"dacf0503b95c88a9","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Iso}_{\\mathcal E_I}$ 采用 [[16-df-pullback-square]]；$\\mathrm{FibCCC}$ 是下文定义的谓词。$\\gamma^{-1}$ 仅用于 $\\mathrm{FibFinProd}(p)$ 成立的分支。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"u^*:\\mathcal E_J\\to\\mathcal E_I","display":false},{"tex":"u:I\\to J","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FibFinProd}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CCC}","display":false},{"tex":"\\gamma_{u,A,B}:u^*(A\\times_JB)\\to u^*A\\times_Iu^*B","display":false},{"tex":"c","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Iso}_{\\mathcal E_I}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FibCCC}","display":false},{"tex":"\\gamma^{-1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FibFinProd}(p)","display":false},{"tex":"\\gamma_{u,A,B}\\coloneqq\\langle u^*\\pi_1,u^*\\pi_2\\rangle.","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{FibCCC}(p)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{FibFinProd}(p)\\land(\\forall I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)\\mathrm{CCC}(\\mathcal E_I)\\\\\n&\\land(\\forall I,J\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)\n(\\forall u\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal B}(I,J))\n(\\forall X,Y\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_J)\\\\\n&\\qquad(\\exists c\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E_I}(u^*(Y^X),(u^*Y)^{u^*X}))\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{Iso}_{\\mathcal E_I}(c)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\qquad\\land\\operatorname{ev}_{u^*X,u^*Y}\\circ(c\\times_I\\operatorname{id}_{u^*X})\n=u^*(\\operatorname{ev}_{X,Y})\\circ\\gamma_{u,Y^X,X}^{-1}\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"c","display":false},{"tex":"u^*(Y^X)\\times_Iu^*X","display":false},{"tex":"u^*(Y^X\\times_JX)","display":false}],"bytes":2448,"backlinks":[{"id":"6fdaaa990a4fe51a","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ClosedCompr}$、$\\mathrm{FibPre}$、$\\mathrm{FibCCC}$、$\\mathrm{FibFinCoprod}$、$\\mathrm{Generic}_q$ 分别采用 [[16-df-closed-comprehension]]、[[16-df-fibred-preorder]]、[[16-df-fibred-cartesian-closed]]、[[16-df-fibred-finite-coproducts]]、[[16-df-generic-object]]；$\\mathrm{Cartesian}_p$ 见 [[16-df-cartesian-morphism]]。"},{"id":"66d3058a6ae62dc5","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$ 为纤维化；相关结构分别见 [[16-df-coherent-fibration]]、[[16-df-fibred-cartesian-closed]]、[[16-df-simple-quantification]]。"},{"id":"928bcf665de24775","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$ 为带提升选择的纤维化。$\\mathrm{PolyFib}$ 采用 [[16-df-polymorphic-fibration]]，$\\mathrm{FibCCC}$ 采用 [[16-df-fibred-cartesian-closed]]，$\\mathrm{CCC}$ 采用 [[16-df-ccc-definition]]。$\\mathrm{Generic}_p(G)$ 采用基本多态纤维化明确引用的泛对象定义。"},{"id":"cf9397afecc15874","anchor":"ref-15","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FibCCC}$ 的定义及结构参数见 [[16-df-fibred-cartesian-closed]]。"},{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[16-df-category]]、[[16-df-functor]]、[[16-df-natural-transformation-definition]]、[[16-df-adjoint-functors]]、[[16-df-finite-limits]]、[[16-df-pullback-square]]、[[16-df-subobject-classifier]]、[[16-df-elementary-topos]]、[[16-df-nno]]、[[16-df-fibre]]、[[16-df-fibred-finite-products]]、[[16-df-fibred-finite-coproducts]]、[[16-df-fibred-cartesian-closed]]、[[16-df-fibre-finite-limits]]、[[16-df-finite-product-preserving-functor]]。"},{"id":"03e3216b8128fbcd","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FibCCC}$ 的定义及结构参数见 [[16-df-fibred-cartesian-closed]]。"}],"outgoing":["ee7c0663947fd7d2","18a4c8ba03fadf06","dacf0503b95c88a9"]}